  "title": "Babcock & Wilcox Announces Full Redemption of Notes",
  "summary": "B&amp;W issued a notice of redemption for all $61.4 million aggregate principal amount outstanding of our 6.50% Senior Notes due 2026, which were issued pursuant to an indenture, dated as of February 12, 2021, as supplemented by the First Supplemental indenture, dated as of February 12, 2021, and further supplemented by the Second Supplemental indenture, dated as of December 13, 2021, between us and The Bank of New York Mellon Trust Company, N.A., as trustee.",
